---
---
<div class="diagram-wrap">
  <p class="diagram-label">Booking Widget — Wait vs. Build</p>

  <div class="node node-dark">
    <div>9 of 15 roofing customers need a booking widget.</div>
    <div class="node-sub">No native feature. Manual build takes 1 day + 2 people each.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="v-line"></div>
  <div class="h-line"></div>

  <div class="decision-row">
    <div class="d-col">
      <div class="v-drop"></div>
      <div class="option-card">
        <div class="option-letter">Option A</div>
        <div class="option-title">Wait for the native feature</div>
        <div class="option-desc">Clean. No technical debt.</div>
        <div class="cost-row">
          <span class="cost-label">Cost</span>
          Customers go live without booking. Inbound leads lost. 10DLC compliance still blocked.
        </div>
        <div class="badge badge-plain">Not chosen</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="d-col">
      <div class="v-drop"></div>
      <div class="option-card option-card-chosen">
        <div class="option-letter option-letter-blue">Option B</div>
        <div class="option-title">Build a prototype now</div>
        <div class="option-desc">React + TypeScript + Supabase. Multi-tenant. Four booking modes.</div>
        <div class="cost-row">
          <span class="cost-label">Cost</span>
          6 hours to build. Not production-ready — but enough to get the feature back on the roadmap with full requirements.
        </div>
        <div class="badge badge-chosen">Chosen</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="h-line"></div>
  <div class="v-line"></div>

  <div class="node node-dark">
    Feature reprioritized. Native booking widget now in development with requirements shaped by the prototype.
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .diagram-wrap {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 32px 28px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    margin: 2rem 0;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }
  .diagram-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .node {
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-background);
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .node-dark {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #F9F7F4;
    border-color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  .node-dark .node-sub {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: rgba(249, 247, 244, 0.6);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .v-line {
    width: 1px;
    height: 20px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .h-line {
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-border);
  }
  .v-drop {
    width: 1px;
    height: 14px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .decision-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .d-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .option-card {
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-background);
    padding: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .option-card-chosen {
    border-color: var(--color-blue);
  }
  .option-letter {
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .option-letter-blue {
    color: var(--color-blue);
  }
  .option-title {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .option-desc {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .cost-row {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-top: 10px;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .cost-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .badge-plain {
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .badge-chosen {
    background: var(--color-blue);
    color: #F9F7F4;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-blue);
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .decision-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .v-drop {
      display: none;
    }
    .h-line {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
